</span></div><h2 class="pfl-buy__title">Peakflex Knee Sleeve
</h2><div class="pfl-text" ><p>Relieve <strong>knee pain</strong> and enjoy greater freedom, or get your money back.</p></div><div class="pfl-text" ><p>More stability, more safety, and more confidence with every step.</p></div><div class="pfl-proof" style="--proof-w: 150px;" ><img src="https://www.trypeakflex.com/cdn/shop/files/Kein_Titel_450_x_150_px.webp?v=1792006239&amp;width=450" alt="Over 20,000 happy knees" srcset="https://www.trypeakflex.com/cdn/shop/files/Kein_Titel_450_x_150_px.webp?v=1792006239&amp;width=352 352w, https://www.trypeakflex.com/cdn/shop/files/Kein_Titel_450_x_150_px.webp?v=1792006239&amp;width=450 450w" width="450" height="150" loading="lazy" class="pfl-proof__img">
<div class="pfl-proof__copy"><p class="pfl-proof__title">Over 20,000 happy knees</p><p class="pfl-proof__text">More than 121,957 people trust Peakflex</p></div>
              </div><details
  class="pfl-acc pfl-acc--box"

>
  <summary class="pfl-acc__sum"><img src="https://www.trypeakflex.com/cdn/shop/files/ChatGPT_Image_26._Mai_2026_12_16_36.webp?v=1792006239&amp;width=80" alt="" srcset="https://www.trypeakflex.com/cdn/shop/files/ChatGPT_Image_26._Mai_2026_12_16_36.webp?v=1792006239&amp;width=80 80w" width="80" height="71" loading="lazy" class="pfl-acc__icon">
<span class="pfl-acc__title">Based on clinical research</span>
    <svg class="pfl-acc__chev" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
  </summary>
  <div class="pfl-acc__body"><p>Compression, lateral stabilization, and patellar support are approaches that have been studied in clinical trials:</p><p><a href="https://journals.plos.org/plosone/article?id=10.1371/journal.pone.0324864" target="_blank" title="PLOS One Netzwerk-Meta-Analyse (2025)">PLOS One Netzwerk-Meta-Analyse (2025)</a> — Analysis of 139 randomized controlled trials. Knee braces were identified as the most effective type of intervention for reducing symptoms in knee osteoarthritis.</p><p><a href="https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC12260456/" target="_blank" title="Ayık et al. (2025)">Ayık et al. (2025)</a> — A randomized study involving 60 patients. Knee braces with lateral stabilizers improved balance and reduced pain in patients with knee osteoarthritis immediately after application.</p><p><a href="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/24917049/" target="_blank" title="Patella Pro Studie, BMC (2014)">Patella Pro Studie, BMC (2014)</a> — A multicenter randomized trial involving 156 patients. Medial patellar stabilization as a clinically evaluated approach for anterior knee pain.</p><p><em>The studies refer to the method (compression, stabilization, and patellar support), not to this specific product.</em></p></div>
</details>

